Description: Provides tools to evaluate the structural topology of alignment
    gaps and residues using unweighted pair group method with arithmetic mean
    (UPGMA) clustering and dynamic tree-cutting as described in Langfelder,
    Zhang, and Horvath (2008) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btm563>. Generates
    bootstrapped distance dendrograms with polytomy condensation alongside 
    highlights for multiple sequence alignments.
